  "id": "BIT-mongodb-2026-13058",
  "summary": "Transaction Command Insufficient Input Validation Leading to Process Termination",
  "details": "An authenticated user with basic write privileges can cause the mongod process to terminate abnormally by sending a crafted transaction command with an incomplete set of required fields. The issue stems from inconsistent validation across related transaction command parameters, resulting in a fatal internal invariant failure and denial of service.",
